<title>RUSSIA: Russian monthly PPI quickens to 0.9 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Russian monthly PPI quickens to 0.9 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 0.9 percent in June after May's 0.5 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  June 97    May 97    Dec 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change  +0.9	 +0.5	+6.3</p>
<p>Note - The committee did not provide comparative figures for June 1996.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
